  "deployment_gates": [
    "Provision and independently read back every table and column in Catalyst Development only.",
    "Keep actual table API names, project identifiers, routes, and all populated values outside GitHub.",
    "Provision exactly 25 Available admission-slot rows per deployment before its Test_Status can be Live.",
    "Prove Catalyst enforces one global immutable ADMISSION_KEY in the admission ledger and one current nullable ADMISSION_ID across pre-provisioned slots; if nullable uniqueness is not enforced, replace the slot-claim strategy before any phone route.",
    "Prove the authoritative no-call transition atomically commits the ReleasedNoCall ledger tombstone, clears exactly one matching slot, and decrements admitted capacity without changing handled-call count; partial release is prohibited.",
    "Verify unique insert and conditional ZCQL update behavior with concurrent synthetic requests before any phone route.",
    "Implement ingress as authenticated queue-only receipt persistence and process notification/Analytics in an out-of-band worker; synchronous synthetic core execution is not a deployable webhook path.",
    "Verify encrypted-text and private-field behavior; repository type labels are intent, not live-state proof.",
    "Block all app-user and client table access.",
    "Do not deploy this source to Production; the runtime configuration rejects Production before Data Store access."
  ]
